OL,3,GNEWSA'People ignore my epileptic fits
OL,4,Abecause they think I'm drunk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn epileptic man who was left having a
OL,7,Fseizure alone on a busy street has
OL,8,Furged people to be more understanding
OL,9,Fof his condition.
OL,11,FJoe Robbins collapsed at around midday
OL,12,Fon Saturday 10 October, close to a main
OL,13,Fjunction in Leamington Spa and near a
OL,14,Fpopular local pub, but no one stopped
OL,15,Fto help him.
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old from Warwickshire has
OL,18,Fbeen living with epilepsy since he was
OL,19,Fsix, but said it had become more common
OL,20,Ffor people to walk by if he has a
OL,21,Fseizure while out and about.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
