OL,3,GNEWSA'People ignore my epileptic fits
OL,4,Abecause they think I'm drunk'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think people just assume I'm either
OL,7,Fdrunk or on drugs or just acting
OL,8,Ferratic," he said.
